OL,3,GNEWSAJob losses as glass company enters
OL,4,Aadministration
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 300 jobs are being lost after a
OL,7,Fmajor glass manufacturer entered
OL,8,Fadministration.
OL,10,FClayton Glass is to close its
OL,11,Fheadquarters in Harelaw, County Durham,
OL,12,Fwith 189 workers being made redundant.
OL,14,FA further 101 jobs will be lost at the
OL,15,Fcompany's sites in Blackburn and North
OL,16,FLanarkshire.
OL,18,FThe company, which employs 573 people
OL,19,Facross seven UK sites, entered
OL,20,Fadministration on 18 September after it
OL,21,Fbecame unable to meet its financial
OL,22,Fobligations.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
